Text/3D "This is 3D text" text0
Text/3D/size=24 "This is smaller 3D text" text1
Text/2D "This is 2D text" text2
Text/2D/size=24 "This is smaller 2D text" text3
Text    "This is bitmap text" text4
Text/size=24    "This is smaller bitmap text" text5

Tran text0 x -1 y 1
Tran text1 x -1 y 0.75
Tran text2 x -1 y 0.5
Tran text3 x -1 y 0.25
Tran text4 x -1 y 0.0
Tran text5 x -1 y -0.25

Group text0, text5 texts
Rot texts cy, 1
Rot texts x, 20
